  code.

  - [1mSecond [38;5;153m<script>[39m tag + global[0m — [38;5;153msettings.js[39m defines something like [38;5;153mwindow.AppSettings[39m, loaded before [38;5;153mapp.js[39m in
    [38;5;153mindex.html[39m. Matches the repo exactly as it is, works from [38;5;153mfile://[39m, nothing else changes. Costs: adds a global, and
